msgid ""
"A bundle from the update package builder (<code>scripts/update_builder.sh</"
"code>). Before anything changes, the device checks its signature, that it is "
"for this device and that there is room for it, and saves the database to the "
"SD card. If the new version doesn't come up, the previous one is put back "
"automatically. The kiosk shows \"We'll be right back\" meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Ein Paket aus dem Update-Paket-Builder (<code>scripts/update_builder.sh</"
"code>). Bevor sich etwas ändert, prüft das Gerät die Signatur, dass das "
